</figure>
<div id="S4.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">roles of these components. When evaluating the overall performance, CAA and CSOC individually contribute average performance gains of 2.35 pp and 6.97 pp, respectively, while their combination yields a <span id="S4.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10.65 pp</span> improvement, reinforcing the effectiveness and robustness of our design.</p>
</div>
